The code statements that lead to the bug are:
```c
if (args->type == DRM_XE_MEM_RANGE_ATTR_PAT) {
    pat_index = array_index_nospec(args->pat_index.val, xe->pat.n_entries);
    coh_mode = xe_pat_index_get_coh_mode(xe, pat_index);
